OL,3,AWhite House lifts tariffs on some
OL,4,ACanadian goods as midterm elections
OL,5,Aloom
OL,6,
OL,7,FRepublican Senator Susan Collins, who
OL,8,Fis in a tight race to keep her seat in
OL,9,FMaine, first announced the exemptions,
OL,10,Fsaying they would help her state's
OL,11,Fagriculture industry.
OL,13,FThe US imposed a 50% levy on $20bn
OL,14,F(#15bn) worth of Canadian goods after
OL,15,Ftrade talks between the two countries
OL,16,Fcollapsed in August.
